          "alt": "The marking scheme's completed oligopoly diagram, Price up the vertical axis and Quantity along the horizontal. A blue KINKED average revenue curve labelled AR, shallow above the kink and steep below it; a red marginal revenue curve that breaks and drops vertically under the kink; a green rising marginal cost curve labelled MC. Point E is where MC passes through the vertical break in MR. An orange arrow runs from E down to the quantity axis at Q1, and another runs from the kink across to the price axis at P1.",
