    section: "B", questionRef: "2025 OL Q16(a)(ii)",
    stem: "Excise duty is charged on certain goods such as alcohol, tobacco and petrol.",
    questionText: "Explain one reason why the government places taxes on goods such as alcohol and cigarettes.",
